# Above a message the person allowed a guest to send into the chat, rather
# than typing it: who wrote it and the tool that relayed it, such as
# "Bob via tma · guest". Both names come from that tool.
chat-guest-label = { $name } via { $tool } · guest
# Heads a guest's prompt waiting for the person to send it to the agent or
# decline it. Both names come from the tool that relayed it.
chat-guest-asks = { $name } via { $tool }, a guest, asks to send this to the agent:
